13
00:01:02,180 --> 00:01:04,160
(He said he'd take care of me.)

14
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:07,500
(What exactly am I
to Okumi-san?)

15
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:13,900
Are you okay?

16
00:01:14,340 --> 00:01:15,860
