23
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:31,900
Hey, Hizaki.

24
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:34,016
You used to work part-time at
that cafe in the back alley, right?

25
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:36,640
Okumi-san and I used to go there sometimes.
Don't you remember me?

26
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:38,640
Ah.

27
00:01:40,100 --> 00:01:41,520
