29
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:47,360
I'll handle the rest.

30
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:50,640
Then I'll just put these documents
away and head out.

31
00:01:51,460 --> 00:01:52,936
- Good work today.
- I'll be taking off.

32
00:01:52,960 --> 00:01:53,960
Good work.

33
00:02:00,820 --> 00:02:03,660
"Are the Sexy Buttocks Not Good?"

34
00:02:04,100 --> 00:02:05,100
(Episode 5)

35
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:08,700
