"I'll handle the rest."

36
00:02:09,860 --> 00:02:11,580
No, I need to step up my game.

37
00:02:13,600 --> 00:02:14,660
Ai-chan.

38
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:20,660
Good work today.

39
00:02:22,180 --> 00:02:23,600
Good work to you too, Okumi-san.

40
00:02:28,140 --> 00:02:29,140
