47
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:55,800
You dirty old man.

48
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:57,680
Come here.

49
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:03,640
Such sexy Band-Aids?

50
00:03:04,540 --> 00:03:06,820
- Whose fault is that?
- Mine.

51
00:03:20,200 --> 00:03:21,360
Stop.

52
00:03:25,720 --> 00:03:27,000
Since it's my fault,

53
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,080
let me take care of you.

54
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,080
What does that even mean?

55
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:36,420
You've been saying stuff like
you'll take care of me for a while now.

56
00:03:37,400 --> 00:03:39,280
Every time you come
over, I'm reminded of that.

57
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:41,360
Ah.

58
00:03:41,720 --> 00:03:43,160
I think...

59
00:03:43,280 --> 00:03:44,480
I remember now too.

60
00:03:45,080 --> 00:03:46,280
Naughty Ai-chan.

61
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,810
Jeez! You idiot!

62
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:56,619
Huh?

63
00:03:56,620 --> 00:03:58,120
Didn't you go home?

64
00:04:09,940 --> 00:04:11,899
I don't know what happened, but...

65
00:04:11,900 --> 00:04:14,339
What should we do?
Do you know where Hizaki lives?

66
00:04:14,340 --> 00:04:15,340
No idea.

67
00:04:15,600 --> 00:04:17,000
I guess I'll take him to my place.

68
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:19,740
Crap.

69
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:21,999
I left my wallet at the office.
I'll go get it.

70
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,019
Huh?

71
00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:24,180
- Right now?
- Yes, right now.

72
00:04:27,020 --> 00:04:28,960
He's always in such a rush.

73
00:04:32,220 --> 00:04:33,220
Hizaki.

74
00:04:33,740 --> 00:04:35,020
Your phone is ringing.

75
00:04:36,180 --> 00:04:37,180
Hizaki.

76
00:04:38,180 --> 00:04:39,520
Answer it for me.

77
00:04:43,500 --> 00:04:47,000
(Incoming Call: Okumi-san)

78
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:49,640
