79
00:04:53,420 --> 00:04:54,420
Hello?

80
00:04:55,320 --> 00:04:56,380
Ai-chan?

81
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:59,580
It really is the president.

82
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:06,880
Ai-chan.

83
00:05:07,580 --> 00:05:08,580
President.

84
00:05:09,700 --> 00:05:11,340
It really is Uchida.

85
00:05:12,580 --> 00:05:13,580
Sorry about that.

86
00:05:14,420 --> 00:05:15,420
No worries.

87
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,700
Ai-chan, get up.
We're going home.

88
00:05:19,060 --> 00:05:20,480
Come on, get up, Ai-chan.

89
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:21,800
Hey, get up.

90
00:05:21,860 --> 00:05:23,540
Come on, up you go.

91
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,600
Here.

92
00:05:25,580 --> 00:05:26,580
One, two.

93
00:05:27,600 --> 00:05:28,620
Heave-ho! Come on.

94
00:05:29,440 --> 00:05:30,440
Wait.

95
00:05:33,760 --> 00:05:35,040
Okumi-san.

96
00:05:37,080 --> 00:05:40,479
I'm always getting mad.
Doesn't it annoy you?

97
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,580
Someone like me.

98
00:05:43,180 --> 00:05:45,380
Well, I'm the one making you mad.

99
00:05:46,260 --> 00:05:47,960
I think you're pretty cute like this.

100
00:05:49,980 --> 00:05:52,180
Let's go back to my place today.

101
00:05:56,180 --> 00:05:57,180
Actually,

102
00:05:57,980 --> 00:05:59,180
why don't we move in together?

103
