I don't want to move in together.

104
00:06:04,380 --> 00:06:05,380
I see.

105
00:06:05,980 --> 00:06:06,980
You don't want to.

106
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:09,840
You know,

107
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:16,400
I don't want to be cute or
someone who needs protecting.

108
00:06:19,580 --> 00:06:22,600
I want to be a man you can rely on.

109
00:07:00,200 --> 00:07:02,580
Why am I at Okumi-san's place...?

110
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:26,220
(I have somewhere important to be,
so I headed out early.)

111
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,640
Okumi.

112
00:07:50,980 --> 00:07:51,980
This is really good.

113
00:08:01,170 --> 00:08:03,410
- Uchida-san.
- Good morning, Hizaki.

114
00:08:04,010 --> 00:08:06,060
I'm really sorry about yesterday.

115
00:08:06,780 --> 00:08:08,479
About the president...

116
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:09,920
I won't tell anyone.

117
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:11,256
