121
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:23,140
I thought he just hired me
to mess with me.

122
00:08:24,360 --> 00:08:28,060
You thought you got in through the
back door because you're his lover?

123
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:36,220
No way. You got in
on your own merit, Hizaki.

124
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:40,560
But I'm completely useless.
I really want to be helpful.

125
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,159
Then why don't you try taking
a computer certification exam?

126
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:45,280
- It'll boost your confidence.
- I'll do it.

127
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:48,000
I want to become someone
like you, Uchida-san.

128
00:09:04,140 --> 00:09:07,060
You actually show up for the death
anniversary of someone you didn't love.

129
00:09:09,580 --> 00:09:10,880
It's been a while.

130
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:16,080
Then again, you've got
some nerve showing up here.

131
00:09:37,080 --> 00:09:38,700
(The rice balls were delicious.)

132
00:09:38,740 --> 00:09:39,840
