Were you waiting for me?

135
00:10:14,340 --> 00:10:16,160
No, I just got here.

136
00:10:17,380 --> 00:10:19,320
I just really wanted to see you.

137
00:10:21,680 --> 00:10:23,000
Do you want to come up for a bit?

138
00:10:24,900 --> 00:10:27,140
I got to see your face,
so I'll just head home for today.

139
00:10:31,460 --> 00:10:32,460
I don't know why, but...

140
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:33,830
Are you feeling a bit down?

141
