142
00:10:37,913 --> 00:10:38,956
But...

143
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:42,013
(I can tell he's not his usual self.)

144
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:45,640
(And yet, I don't
understand anything at all.)

145
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,200
Cheer up.

146
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:13,260
That's the first time
Ai-chan kissed me outside.

147
00:11:15,140 --> 00:11:16,260
Are you an idiot?

148
00:11:26,260 --> 00:11:29,020
I don't want to be treated like a kid,

149
00:11:31,040 --> 00:11:34,940
but I still end up being led around
by Okumi-san.

150
00:11:40,860 --> 00:11:44,040
I want to protect Okumi-san too.

151
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:49,360
Even though I'm nowhere
near ready for that yet.

152
00:11:57,500 --> 00:11:58,500
You know,

153
00:11:59,120 --> 00:12:03,340
I really do love Okumi-san.

154
00:12:14,230 --> 00:12:15,400
That should be good, right?

155
00:12:16,030 --> 00:12:18,430
- That's great.
- Oh, right.

156
00:12:18,680 --> 00:12:20,440
We're getting an intern
at the company soon.

157
00:12:20,640 --> 00:12:21,720
An intern?

158
00:12:21,820 --> 00:12:24,660
You're going to be a
senior now. Do your best.

159
00:12:25,160 --> 00:12:26,160
Got it.

160
00:12:28,180 --> 00:12:32,540
(I feel like I'm a little closer
to being a man who can protect Okumi-san.)

161
00:12:40,300 --> 00:12:42,000
It's been a while, Hideaki.

162
00:12:47,240 --> 00:12:48,476
(Next Episode Preview)
I'm Kujo Hiroto.

163
00:12:48,500 --> 00:12:51,580
Having you stare at me like that
makes my heart race.

164
00:12:51,820 --> 00:12:52,980
What about my feelings?

165
00:12:53,080 --> 00:12:54,416
I don't believe in that kind of stuff.

166
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:58,080
After all, the time Ai-chan and I have spent
together means something entirely different.

167
00:12:58,580 --> 00:13:01,060
Just be a good boy and accept my love.
